        <technology>
            <technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses>System boundaries include olive farming, olive oil extraction with pomace as a co-product and pomace oil extraction from pomace with olive stones granulate as a co-product. For the olive oil extraction, 3 phase centrifugation is used. On the other hand, solvent extraction is used in the pomace oil mill.    Economical allocation was used in the olive oil extraction and mass allocation was used in the pomace oil extraction.</technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses>
            <technologicalApplicability>na</technologicalApplicability>
            <referenceToTechnologyFlowDiagrammOrPicture refObjectId="4562465a-92b8-5dc0-b302-692e4e067f38" type="source data set" uri="../sources/4562465a-92b8-5dc0-b302-692e4e067f38.xml" version="04.00.001">
